{"version":1,"content":"<p>調查宏福苑大火成因的獨立委員會報告今日（29日）對外公布，特首李家超和相關官員將在下午2時45分，於政府總部舉行報告相關事宜的記者會，料將交代改革方案。</p><p>《明報》將持續更新記者會詳情。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.324755+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:59:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T01:38:13.448075+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.324755+00:00","content_hash":"3095d22dbbacbafa03034b24fafd8c43efef613c24bb8c2b2ad5ed08ca798b07","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.324755+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-blocked","latest_error":"HTTP 403"},"content_capture":null}